WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en-IN

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.320
In the past 2 months,

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:02.040
In the past 2 months,

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:05.120
you must've found out something
about the person we're looking for.

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:05.680
Tell me what that is.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:08.600
Not just me...

00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:10.000
even you can't trace him.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:14.560
Tiger

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.800
Muthuvel Pandian

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:22.480
Hey, Driver!

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.120
Hey, Driver!

00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:25.640
We asked you to be here at 08:00 a.m.
But you're here early at 07:00 a.m.

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:26.160
Get lost!

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:29.600
Just as we thought, he didn’t 
go into hiding after killing Varman.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:30.520
What do you mean?

00:00:30.840 --> 00:00:32.520
Is there anyone above him?

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.880
Can only the Jailer set up snipers?

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:39.080
Why wouldn't I?

00:00:41.920 --> 00:00:43.280
You're aware of Kalpaks!

00:00:43.400 --> 00:00:44.640
Oh, really? I'm not aware!

00:00:45.680 --> 00:00:46.440
Shall we get to know them?

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.600
More than you killing him...

00:00:50.680 --> 00:00:53.960
we must all see him suffer 
and plead to death.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:55.600
Bear this in mind, Kalpaks!

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:59.240
Installing a camera, being cunning,
sending your men to intimidate us,

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.920
these antics are from your father's time.

00:01:00.960 --> 00:01:01.920
The current style is...

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.840
inviting all the enemies under one roof

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:04.280
and then...

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.040
and then...

00:01:06.760 --> 00:01:07.800
bomb them!

